      <Value><![CDATA[This survey aims to explore people's caffeine consumption habits, including how often they consume caffeinated drinks, their preferred sources of caffeine, and how caffeine affects their sleep, energy levels, and daily activities. Your responses will help us better understand caffeine use and its effects on everyday life.]]></Value>
